        # Add N10's explanation only after the snapshot owner has compared the
        # canonical, on-disk barrier.  This annotation is diagnostic output,
        # not a new barrier generation and must not create a false snapshot
        # mismatch in the current transaction.
        if expired_foreign_clearance_details:
